{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"ISA","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"以赛亚书","commonName":"以赛亚书","title":"以赛亚书","order":23,"numberOfChapters":66,"sha256":"632dd4147026fa600518a3f00c24b6fa8a338b17185b54576ae9104ec0242142","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":66,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/66.json","totalNumberOfVerses":1289},"chapter":{"number":48,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["顽梗的以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“雅各家啊，听我说！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们被称为以色列人，是犹大的子孙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们凭耶和华的名起誓、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"呼求以色列的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却不真心诚意。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们还自称为圣城的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"声称倚靠名为万军之耶和华的以色列的上帝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"“过去所发生的事，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我很久以前就预言过、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亲口宣告过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"然后使它们瞬间发生。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道你顽梗，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有铁一般的颈项，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"铜一般的额头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，在很久以前，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事情还没有发生时就向你预言，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你说这些是你的偶像做的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是你雕刻和铸造的偶像命定的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"“你已经听见了，看看这一切，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"难道你还不承认吗？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在我要把新事，把你不知道的隐秘事告诉你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这些事是现在造的，古时没有，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在今天以前你从未听过，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"免得你说，‘看啊，这些事我早就知道了。’","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你从未听见过，也不曾知道，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的耳朵从未开通。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我知道你生性诡诈，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你自出母胎就被称为悖逆之徒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"“我为了我的名，暂时忍怒；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我为了我的荣耀，压住怒气，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"不消灭你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"看啊，我熬炼你，但不像在火炉中炼银子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是在苦难的炉中熬炼你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我这样做是全然为了自己，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我岂能让自己的名受亵渎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我必不把自己的荣耀给别人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各啊，我所呼召的以色列啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"听我说！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我是耶和华，我是首先的，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也是末后的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我亲手奠立大地的根基，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的右手铺展诸天。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我一呼唤，它们都侍立一旁。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"text":"“你们一起来听吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"哪个偶像曾预言过这些事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华所爱的人必成就祂对巴比伦的旨意，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他的臂膀必攻击迦勒底人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯有我说过这些事，并且呼召了他。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我领他出来，他必一路亨通。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们到我跟前来听吧。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我一开始就没有暗地里说话，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"事情发生的时候，我就在场。”","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"现在主耶和华差来我和祂的灵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的救赎主——以色列的圣者耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“我是你的上帝耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我教导你，使你受益，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我引导你走当行的路。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"唯愿你当时肯听我的命令！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"那样，你的平安必像滚滚河水，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的公义必如滔滔海浪；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的后裔必多如海沙，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的子孙必像细沙一样不可胜数，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们的名号绝不会从我面前被铲除、被消灭。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"text":"你们要离开巴比伦，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"逃离迦勒底人。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们要高声欢呼，向普天下传扬、宣告：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“耶和华救赎了祂的仆人雅各！”","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和华带领他们经过沙漠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们没有口渴。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"为了他们，祂使水从磐石中流出，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂使磐石裂开、涌出水来。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":22,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：“恶人得不到平安。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/48.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/49.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/ISA/47.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":22}